        "reason": "证明 fragment 入口、关系数量限制、不可解析禁用和空状态。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/codewiki/SymbolFrame.vue",
          "startLine": 134,
          "endLine": 180
        },
        "quote": "function openFragment() {\n  if (symbol.value?.fragmentId)\n    emit(\"drill\", { type: \"fragment\", fragmentId: symbol.value.fragmentId, title: symbol.value.name });\n}\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"symbol-frame\">\n    <div v-if=\"loadError\" class=\"error-banner\" role=\"alert\">\n      符号加载失败：{{ loadError }}\n      <OmButton"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "符号边接口失败是否应与“确实没有边”区分，并统一使用人类可读关系名称？",
        "why": "当前边请求异常被转为空数组，模板随即展示“暂无登记边”；同时徽标直接渲染 `edgeKind`，可能暴露内部枚举且造成误判。",
        "nextStep": "确认错误降级与标签合同，补充同文件边、入边、不可解析边、超过 60 条及边请求失败的组件测试。",
